  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8002.20 Sole shareholder",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8002.20 “Sole shareholder” means any person who operates his/her business entity as its only shareholder, with no other employees and who has registered the business entity as a corporation, with the person holding all offices of the corporation.\n\nSource. #9542, eff 9-10-09",
